#!/bin/sh
# Language server for justfiles (VS Code "Just" extension needs this
# separately from the `just` CLI itself, installed by
# run_once_install-just.sh.tmpl).
if command -v just-lsp >/dev/null 2>&1; then
    echo "just-lsp already installed"
{{- if eq .profile "private" }}
else
    [ -x /home/linuxbrew/.linuxbrew/bin/brew ] && eval "$(/home/linuxbrew/.linuxbrew/bin/brew shellenv)"
    brew install just-lsp
{{- else if eq .profile "work" }}
else
    # No Homebrew in "work"/devcontainer contexts - fetch the prebuilt
    # binary from GitHub Releases (github.com/terror/just-lsp) instead.
    arch="$(uname -m)"
    case "$arch" in
        x86_64) target="x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu" ;;
        aarch64|arm64) target="aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu" ;;
        *)
            echo "just-lsp: unsupported architecture '$arch', skipping" >&2
            exit 0
            ;;
    esac
    version="$(curl -fsSL https://api.github.com/repos/terror/just-lsp/releases/latest | grep -m1 '"tag_name"' | cut -d '"' -f4)"
    mkdir -p "$HOME/.local/bin"
    curl -fsSL "https://github.com/terror/just-lsp/releases/download/${version}/just-lsp-${version}-${target}.tar.gz" \
        | tar -xz -C "$HOME/.local/bin" ./just-lsp
    chmod +x "$HOME/.local/bin/just-lsp"
{{- end }}
fi
